# Source Temple MAP; its Lua count condition is ported to a named hook.
NAME:    eino_temple_lava
TAGS:     temple_altars_10 temple_altars_14
PLACE:   Temple
ORIENT:  encompass
: vault.run("configure")
COLOUR:  c = red
MAP
       cccc    ccc
      cclccccccclcc
   ccccl.lcclccl.lcccc
  cclll...c...c...lllcc
  clll..C.G...G.B..lllc
  cll.....d.B.d.....llc
 ccl..B...d...d......lcc
ccl.......g...g.......lcc
cl..C...............B..lc
ccl...................lcc
 cccGddg.........gddGccc
 cc...................cc
 cl..B......{......B..lc
 cc...................cc
 cccGddg.........gddGccc
ccl...................lcc
cl..B...............C..lc
ccl.......g...g.......lcc
 ccl......d...d...B..lcc
  cll.....d.B.d.....llc
  clll..B.G...G.C..lllc
  cclll...c...c...lllcc
   ccccl.lcclccl.lcccc
      cclccccccclcc
       ccc     ccc
ENDMAP
